    "Single shared commerce stock pool; no multi-warehouse inventory, bins, lot numbers or valuation methods",
    "Current global/creator/purchasing-commerce intersection; human-only writes, recovery and tools",
    "Private read tools only; natural-language purchasing has no execution authority",
    "Pending browser recovery is held in memory; catalog/order selectors paginate up to 1,000 entries with paginated API for larger volumes",
